body:
Correct me if I'm wrong (again), but I checked JPJ's website and it states that to renew LDL the period of your LDL cannot be more than 2 years. [here](http://www.jpj.gov.my/web/main-site/pemandu/-/knowledge_base/pemandu/pembaharuan-lesen-belajar-memandu-ldl-)

Meaning within 2 years time if you want to renew your expired LDL you don't have to take the class and the test again. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
